<Prose bg="overview" title="Privacy policy" desc="How GovPulse handles personal data: no cookies, cookieless analytics, GDPR and CCPA rights, and how to contact us." template>
<h2>Summary</h2>
<ul><li>By default, browsing GovPulse does not set cookies and does not use tracking pixels or advertising networks.</li><li>We may use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is cookieless and does not fingerprint visitors, to count page views in aggregate.</li><li>If you subscribe or buy a plan, we process the data needed to provide it (email, billing details handled by our payment provider).</li></ul>
<h2>Who we are</h2><p>GovPulse ("we") operates this website. Controller contact: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. [Owner: add legal entity name and postal address.]</p>
<h2>Data we process</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Data</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Legal basis (GDPR)</th><th>Retention</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Server/CDN logs (IP, user agent, URL) via Cloudflare</td><td>Security, abuse prevention, delivery</td><td>Legitimate interests (Art. 6(1)(f))</td><td>Per Cloudflare's retention, typically short-term</td></tr>
<tr><td>Aggregate analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics, if enabled)</td><td>Understand which pages are used</td><td>Legitimate interests</td><td>Aggregated, no personal profile</td></tr>
<tr><td>Email address (newsletter, when launched)</td><td>Send the briefs you asked for</td><td>Consent (Art. 6(1)(a)); withdraw any time</td><td>Until you unsubscribe</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sponsor and enquiry correspondence (name, email, message)</td><td>Manage sponsorships, accounting</td><td>Contract (Art. 6(1)(b)), legal obligation</td><td>As required by tax law</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<h2>Processors</h2><p>Cloudflare, Inc. (hosting, CDN, analytics). If the owner enables it, Google Analytics 4 (Google LLC) is loaded only after you accept analytics cookies. International transfers rely on Standard Contractual Clauses or equivalent safeguards.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2><p><strong>EU/UK (GDPR):</strong> access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability, objection, and the right to complain to your supervisory authority. <strong>California (CCPA/CPRA):</strong> right to know, delete, correct, and to opt out of sale or sharing. We do not sell or share personal information for cross-context behavioural advertising.</p>
<p>To exercise a right, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. We respond within 30 days (GDPR) or 45 days (CCPA).</p>
<h2>Children</h2><p>GovPulse is not directed at children under 16.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2><p>We will post updates on this page with a new date.</p>
</Prose>
